; GRIFO screen-only UI tiles (ui-designer): TITLE / CLEAR / GAMEOVER, drawn with the LCD off.
; VRAM order on those screens: ui (0-23), font (24-64), uiscreens (65-). In game the bg
; tileset overwrites these slots (game.json vram_order: ui font uiscreens).
; Consecutive run: LOGO_00..LOGO_33.

; ---------------- SCREEN group
; multiplication sign on the font baseline (not the letter X)
@ ICON_TIMES
........
........
.#...#..
..#.#...
...#....
..#.#...
.#...#..
........
; battlement: merlon + crenel, repeats every 8 px
@ WALL_TOP
........
#####...
#---#...
#---#...
#---####
#-------
#-------
++++++++
; castle wall bricks, seamless
@ WALL_BRICK
---+----
---+----
---+----
++++++++
-------+
-------+
-------+
++++++++
; sword pommel + grip (points right)
@ SWORD_HILT
........
........
.##.....
#--#####
#-+#+#+#
.##.....
........
........
